{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The museum is yours to care for, but it won\u2019t stay clean on its own. More visitors mean more donations, but also more dirt and trash, which attract bugs. You don't want visitors to spot any, do you? To keep them coming back and your rating growing, you\u2019ll need to keep the museum spotless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a pair of slippers and clean the floor the <i>old-fashioned way</i>. Sort out the trash, chase off bugs before they cause trouble, and polish every corner until it shines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you keep the museum in order, you\u2019ll earn the resources to expand it. Unlock new rooms, bring in fresh furniture, and place pedestals for the rare relics you discover. Each new addition raises the museum\u2019s rating and makes the task of maintaining it even more engaging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Clean the floor by scrubbing with individually controlled slippers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057020/extras/b044aa107a764c6339c8ca406545afd6.poster.avif?t=1774088957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057020/extras/b044aa107a764c6339c8ca406545afd6.webm?t=1774088957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057020/extras/b044aa107a764c6339c8ca406545afd6.mp4?t=1774088957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chase down bugs before they spread chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: